 4. 👀 Jensen succession search 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photos: Getty Images, Nvidia, Apple. Chart: Erin Davis/Axios Nvidia has begun searching for a permanent replacement for longtime CEO Jensen Huang, who resigned yesterday amid scrutiny over reports of multiple extramarital affairs, Axios' Herb Scribner writes .

 Why it matters: Nvidia's next leader will inherit one of the world's most valuable companies — and the daunting task of succeeding the pioneer who transformed it into an AI powerhouse. Some names that have surfaced in reporting and speculation:

 Colette Kress, the new interim CEO of Nvidia, could stay on permanently. Analysts and investors view her as a leading contender because of her financial expertise. ( Reuters ) Tim Cook's name entered the chat yesterday after President Trump suggested the former Apple CEO on Truth Social: "A Legend replaces a Legend!" Johny Srouji , Apple's chief hardware officer. ( Bloomberg ) Jensen's daughter Madison Huang "had been seen as a potential successor before the scandal erupted," the Financial Times reports . Seven more to watch . 

 
 
