 7. 🤠 America&#x27;s cheapest burgers 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: DoorDash . Graphic: Jim Sergent/Axios The cheapest burger meal in America can be found in Laredo, Texas, at $12.75. The most expensive is in Anchorage, Alaska, at $27.88, Axios' Jim Sergent writes. 

 Of the 100 cities in DoorDash's cheeseburger index , California has seven of the 10 most expensive. Texas has four of the cheapest. Read on . 

 
 
